me that looks like social innovation.

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:54.150
So I was looking at schools that had
great social innovation programs and

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.090
then great design thinking programs.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:57.597
Those were kind of my two criteria.

00:05:57.597 --> 00:06:02.478
And so ultimately, that ended up being
a handful of schools and when I got into

00:06:02.478 --> 00:06:07.450
Stanford I was like, love this, these
were the things that I was looking for.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:11.016
So it's kind of hard to deny that
this was the place to be, yeah

00:06:11.016 --> 00:06:13.150
&gt;&gt; Awesome, yeah.

00:06:13.150 --> 00:06:16.050
For me, I think one of the big
things that I was looking for

00:06:16.050 --> 00:06:20.370
was a school that also has a very
reputable healthcare system associated

00:06:20.370 --> 00:06:22.500
